###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The m3gnet package default model is described as trained on 190k MP relaxation configurations and is taken to be the registry model M3GNet-MPF-2021.2.8 (alias 'M3GNet'). MACE-MP-0b (not 0b3) is a paper-local run.
# - Relaxation failure rates, numbers of low-energy and validated structures, false-positive rates (56% and 30%) and Wasserstein distances (0.12 and 0.09) are not energy/force/stress errors.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/jakob2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

